      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَاوِشٌ</span></b>  Water <i>not to be seen,</i> (K,) or <i>hardly to
be seen,</i> (TA,) <i>by reason of its remoteness</i> [<i>from
